the dynamic programming means we tend to update the backend and frontend whem we chage or devoate the backends code at the run time 

  eg if we added some quiry parameters in the url of website then it updates or changes on website 

  also dynamic programmin involves the coding python in our html file that we rendering in the flask


  to code in python in html webpage connected to flask 

{% pythons loop or conditional statement %}
  block
     block
     block                             # under body tag in html
     block
     block
  {% endfor or endif%} 

in this way we can code the python in html file connected to flask

